artial_x H_y - partial_y H_x=0, partial_x E=partial_y E=0, the Debye law gives P_t=0, and every PML/ADE damping or auxiliary source term vanishes. Compact support keeps boundary and interface traces harmless. Thus the state is a nonzero stationary solution with positive magnetic energy for any positive state energy controlling H. Along such a stationary state an autonomous total electromagnetic-Debye energy cannot strictly decrease for every nonzero state. Therefore a valid dissipative identity on the whole computational domain must allow a nullspace containing these undamped curl-free magnetic modes.\",\n  \"critical_errors\": [],\n  \"gaps\": [],\n  \"repair_hints\": \"None.\",\n  \"checked_artifacts\": [\n    \"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction.md\",\n    \"artifacts/proofs/stage3_repaired_model_energy.md\",\n    \"sources/energy_functional_problem.tex\"\n  ],\n  \"checked_fact_ids\": [\n    \"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction\"\n  ],\n  \"primary_fact_ids\": [\n    \"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction\"\n  ],\n  \"target_artifact\": null,\n  \"executor\": \"codex\",\n  \"verification_scope\": \"codex_agent\",\n  \"claim_ceiling_after_verification\": \"verified\",\n  \"agent_run_dir\": \"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet\",\n  \"agent_log\": \"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.log\",\n  \"agent_events_log\": \"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.events.jsonl\",\n  \"agent_stderr_log\": \"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.stderr.log\",\n  \"agent_log_manifest\": \"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T06581