=1 has transmitted normal symbol nu=S_x nu0 and admittance Y_+=S_x^{-1}nu/(mu s)=nu0/(mu s)=Y0, so the continuous interface is perfectly matched. In a time-domain ADE realization of the classical stretch S_i=1+sigma_i/s, the positive physical Debye energy E_phys=1/2 int(eps0 eps_inf E^2+mu H_x^2+mu H_y^2+chi^{-1}P^2) has derivative -int tau/chi P_t^2 plus the sign-indefinite memory couplings int[E(psi_E,x-psi_E,y)-H_x psi_Hx,y+H_y psi_Hy,x]. Therefore the v2 monotone energy identity does not transfer to the exact stretched-coordinate PML without a new augmented/passive-memory energy. See artifacts/proofs/stage3_repaired_model_energy.md.\n./memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md:2:fact_id: fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:alpha1-algebra-balance\n./memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md:7:  - fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:run-20260619T173930696222Z:source-problem\n./memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md:8:status: verified\n./memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md:10:review_level: verified\n./memory/scratch/events.jsonl:4:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T18:05:07.278753Z\",\"channel\":\"events\",\"record\":{\"event_type\":\"fact_add\",\"fact_id\":\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:alpha1-algebra-balance\",\"path\":\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md\",\"resubmit\":false,\"reindexed\":true}}\n./memory/scratch/events.jsonl:5:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T18:09:27.688983Z\",\"channel\":\"events\",\"record\":{\"event_type\":\"fact_promote\",\"fact_id\":\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:alpha1-algebra-balance\",\"path\":\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md\",\"status\":\"verified\",\"verification\":\"verif