n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Correct within the fact's stated scope. The stage-3 artifact proves planar-interface perfect matching for the stretched-coordinate Maxwell-Debye model by keeping the Debye law as (1+tau s)P=chi E and applying S_i^{-1} only to spatial derivatives; at an x-interface with S_y=1 the PML normal symbol satisfies nu=S_x nu0 and the admittance equals the physical admittance. The ADE realization of S_i^{-1}=s/(s+sigma_i) yields the displayed auxiliary variables, and differentiating the naive physical Debye energy gives the negative Debye dissipation term plus the memory couplings E(psi_E,x-psi_E,y)-H_x psi_Hx,y+H_y psi_Hy,x. Those auxiliary couplings have no definite sign in the physical energy alone, so the v2 monotone identity does not transfer to the exact stretched-coordinate ADE system. The same artifact and the prior accepted verification support that only the reduced normal-incidence 1D monotone identity is proved, while the full 2D monotone augmented/passive-memory energy remains an identified gap rather than a claimed theorem.\\\",\\n  \\\"critical_errors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"gaps\\\": [],\\n  \\\"repair_hints\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"checked_artifacts\\\": [\\n    \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m/request.json\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-stretched-coordinate-debye-pml-matching-and-energy-gap.md\\\",\\n    \\\"artifacts/proofs/stage3_repaired_model_energy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"verification/results/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d.json\\\",\\n    \\\"verification/results/verify-20260620T064808296793Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m.json\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-standard-stretched-pml-matching-and-1d-energy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched.md\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-covariantly-damped-debye-energy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"verification/results/verify-20260620T022411192181Z-fact-the-covariantly-damped-alpha-1-maxw.json\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"checked_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:stretched-coordinate-debye-pml-matching-and-energy-gap\\\",\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:standard-stretched-pml-matching-and-1d-energy\\\",\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched\\\",\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:covariantly-damped-debye-energy\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"primary_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:stretched-coordinate-debye-pml-matching-and-energy-gap\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"target_artifact\\\": null,\\n  \\\"executor\\\": \\\"codex\\\",\\n  \\\"verification_scope\\\": \\\"codex_agent\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_ceiling_after_verification\\\": \\\"verified\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_run_dir\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m/codex.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_events_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m/codex.events.jsonl\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_stderr_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m/codex.stderr.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log_manifest\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065326237995Z-fact-the-standard-stretched-coordinate-m/log_manifest.json\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-06-20T06:57:51.379485Z\\\",\\n  \\\"verifier\\\": \\\"iteris.codex_verification_agent\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T070357651402Z-assembly-stage-3-terminal-report-results/codex.events.jsonl:26:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_11\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,260p' verification/results/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d.json\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"iteris.verification_result.v0\\\",\\n  \\\"request_id\\\": \\\"verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d\\\",\\n  \\\"backend\\\": \\\"agent\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"fact\\\",\\n  \\\"claim\\\": \\\"The v2 covariantly damped Maxwell-Debye layer is not perfectly matched at a planar constant x-PML interface, with the squared-admittance mismatch stated in the fact file.\\\",\\n  \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"passed\\\": true,\\n  \\\"strict_verdict\\\": \\\"correct\\\",\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Correct. The cited stage-3 proof uses the verified covariantly damped Maxwell-Debye model from the predecessor fact and the source TM sign conventions. For the physical Maxwell-Debye half-space, the Laplace-Fourier symbol gives H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu_0 E/(mu s), nu_0^2=k_y^2+mu s^2 A(s), hence Y_0^2=A(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2). For the constant x-layer v2 model with rho_x=rho>0 and rho_y=0, the same symbol gives P=chi E/(1+tau(s+rho)), H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu E/(mu(s+rho)), nu^2=mu(s+rho)^2 A_rho(s)+k_y^2(s+rho)/s, hence Y_rho^2=A_rho(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s(s+rho)). Subtracting gives exactly -rho[chi tau/(mu(1+tau(s+rho))(1+tau s))+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2(s+rho))], matching the fact file and the boxed formula in the proof artifact. Since this expression is not identically zero for rho>0 under the stated positive Debye parameters, the admittance mismatch is generically nonzero and the continuous planar-interface reflection coefficient is generically nonzero. The claim is scoped to this planar constant-coefficient x-interface test and does not overclaim more.\\\",\\n  \\\"critical_errors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"gaps\\\": [],\\n  \\\"repair_hints\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"checked_artifacts\\\": [\\n    \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/request.json\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched.md\\\",\\n    \\\"artifacts/proofs/stage3_v2_perfect_matching_test.md\\\",\\n    \\\"results/energy_design_v2_report_verified.md\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-covariantly-damped-debye-energy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"verification/results/verify-20260620T022411192181Z-fact-the-covariantly-damped-alpha-1-maxw.json\\\",\\n    \\\"artifacts/proofs/stage2_repair_design.md\\\",\\n    \\\"sources/energy_functional_problem.tex\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"checked_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched\\\",\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:covariantly-damped-debye-energy\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"primary_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:v2-covariant-model-not-perfectly-matched\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"target_artifact\\\": null,\\n  \\\"executor\\\": \\\"codex\\\",\\n  \\\"verification_scope\\\": \\\"codex_agent\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_ceiling_after_verification\\\": \\\"verified\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_run_dir\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/codex.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_events_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/codex.events.jsonl\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_stderr_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/codex.stderr.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log_manifest\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/log_manifest.json\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-06-20T06:47:46.898285Z\\\",\\n  \\\"verifier\\\": \\\"iteris.codex_verification_agent\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T070357651402Z-assembly-stage-3-terminal-report-results/codex.events.jsonl:28:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_12\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,260p' verification/results/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet.json\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"iteris.verification_result.v0\\\",\\n  \\\"request_id\\\": \\\"verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet\\\",\\n  \\\"backend\\\": \\\"agent\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"fact\\\",\\n  \\\"claim\\\": \\\"Strict decay of total electromagnetic-Debye energy on the whole computational domain is impossible without a nullspace, because nonzero stationary gradient magnetic fields can live in an undamped physical subregion with E=P=0 and zero dissipation.\\\",\\n  \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"passed\\\": true,\\n  \\\"strict_verdict\\\": \\\"correct\\\",\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Correct. The source model and the repaired ADE model both use the 2D TM first-order evolution equations with E, H_x, H_y, P and PML auxiliaries, and the source problem imposes PEC E=0 but no additional divergence constraint. In an open physical subregion where sigma_x=sigma_y=0, choose phi smooth, compactly supported there, with grad phi nonzero, set E=P=0, all auxiliary variables zero, H_x=partial_x phi, and H_y=partial_y phi. Then partial_x H_y - partial_y H_x=0, partial_x E=partial_y E=0, the Debye law gives P_t=0, and every PML/ADE damping or auxiliary source term vanishes. Compact support keeps boundary and interface traces harmless. Thus the state is a nonzero stationary solution with positive magnetic energy for any positive state energy controlling H. Along such a stationary state an autonomous total electromagnetic-Debye energy cannot strictly decrease for every nonzero state. Therefore a valid dissipative identity on the whole computational domain must allow a nullspace containing these undamped curl-free magnetic modes.\\\",\\n  \\\"critical_errors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"gaps\\\": [],\\n  \\\"repair_hints\\\": \\\"None.\\\",\\n  \\\"checked_artifacts\\\": [\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction.md\\\",\\n    \\\"artifacts/proofs/stage3_repaired_model_energy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"sources/energy_functional_problem.tex\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"checked_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"primary_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:whole-domain-strict-decay-nullspace-obstruction\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"target_artifact\\\": null,\\n  \\\"executor\\\": \\\"codex\\\",\\n  \\\"verification_scope\\\": \\\"codex_agent\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_ceiling_after_verification\\\": \\\"verified\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_run_dir\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_events_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.events.jsonl\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_stderr_log\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/codex.stderr.log\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log_manifest\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T065810059861Z-fact-strict-decay-of-total-electromagnet/log_manifest.json\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-06-20T07:01:54.723549Z\\\",\\n  \\\"verifier\\\": \\\"iteris.codex_verification_agent\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T070357651402Z-assembly-stage-3-terminal-report-results/codex.events.jsonl:29:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_13\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"The verified fact outputs all pass, but their scopes are narrow: planar constant interfaces, a reduced 1D energy identity, and an explicit full-2D energy gap. I’m now checking the rest of the terminal report for any broader conclusions than those facts justify.\"}}\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T070357651402Z-assembly-stage-3-terminal-report-results/codex.events.jsonl:31:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_14\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '261,620p' results/energy_design_v3_perfect_matching_report.md\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\\\\[\\nS_i(s)=1+\\\\frac{\\\\sigma_i}{s},\\\\qquad \\\\sigma_i\\\\ge0.\\n\\\\]\\n物理区域 \\\\(\\\\sigma_i=0\\\\)。界面条件为物理切向迹连续；例如 \\\\(x\\\\)-界面连续 \\\\(E,H_y\\\\)。\\n\\n在时域 ADE 形式中，令\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mathcal A_i=S_i^{-1}=\\\\frac{s}{s+\\\\sigma_i},\\n\\\\qquad\\n\\\\mathcal A_i f=f+\\\\psi_i,\\\\quad\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\sigma_i)\\\\psi_i=-\\\\sigma_i f.\\n\\\\]\\n则\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E_t+P_t\\n=\\\\partial_xH_y-\\\\partial_yH_x+\\\\psi_{E,x}-\\\\psi_{E,y},\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mu H_{x,t}=-\\\\partial_yE-\\\\psi_{H_x,y},\\\\qquad\\n\\\\mu H_{y,t}=\\\\partial_xE+\\\\psi_{H_y,x},\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\nP+\\\\tau P_t=\\\\chi E,\\n\\\\]\\n其中\\n\\\\[\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\sigma_x)\\\\psi_{E,x}=-\\\\sigma_x\\\\partial_xH_y,\\\\qquad\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\sigma_y)\\\\psi_{E,y}=-\\\\sigma_y\\\\partial_yH_x,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\sigma_y)\\\\psi_{H_x,y}=-\\\\sigma_y\\\\partial_yE,\\\\qquad\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\sigma_x)\\\\psi_{H_y,x}=-\\\\sigma_x\\\\partial_xE.\\n\\\\]\\n该模型在连续常系数平面界面处 perfectly matched。\\n\\n### 5.2 CFS/ADE generalized stretched PML\\n\\n取更一般的 rational stretch\\n\\\\[\\nS_i(s)=\\\\kappa_i+\\\\frac{\\\\sigma_i}{s+\\\\alpha_i},\\\\qquad\\n\\\\kappa_i\\\\ge1,\\\\quad \\\\sigma_i\\\\ge0,\\\\quad \\\\alpha_i\\\\ge0.\\n\\\\]\\n只要仍然只拉伸空间导数，并保持\\n\\\\[\\n(1+\\\\tau s)\\\\widehat P=\\\\chi\\\\widehat E,\\n\\\\]\\n平面界面处仍有 \\\\(\\\\nu_+=S_x\\\\nu_0\\\\) 和 \\\\(Y_+=Y_0\\\\)。CFS/ADE 版本更适合低频、\\n倏逝波或长时间误差控制，但完整单调能量需要正的记忆核实现；本报告不声称已完成。\\n\\n### 5.3 MPML-type damping\\n\\nMPML 在法向之外增加多轴阻尼，可改善某些模型的长时间稳定性或消除 Jordan 型增长。\\n但一旦切向 stretch 在界面处非平凡，界面导纳通常改变。已检查的 MPML 文献也明确提示\\n多轴版本可能不是 exact perfectly matched。因此本报告把 MPML 归类为稳定/吸收修复，\\n不是本问题的首选 exact matching 修复。\\n\\n## 6. Energy functional construction\\n\\n### 6.1 v2 的完整单调能量\\n\\n已验证的 v2 能量为\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mathcal E_\\\\rho(t)=\\\\frac12\\\\int_\\\\Omega\\n\\\\left(\\n\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E^2+\\\\mu H_x^2+\\\\mu H_y^2+\\\\chi^{-1}P^2\\n\\\\right)\\\\,dxdy.\\n\\\\]\\n正性来自\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\epsilon_0,\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty,\\\\mu,\\\\chi>0.\\n\\\\]\\n用 PEC 外边界 \\\\(E=0\\\\) 消去 Maxwell flux，并用\\n\\\\[\\nE\\\\,D_\\\\rho P\\n=\\\\frac{1}{2\\\\chi}\\\\partial_t(P^2)\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\rho}{\\\\chi}P^2\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}|D_\\\\rho P|^2\\n\\\\]\\n可得\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\boxed{\\n\\\\frac{d}{dt}\\\\mathcal E_\\\\rho(t)\\n=-\\\\int_\\\\Omega\\\\left(\\n\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty\\\\rho E^2\\n+\\\\mu\\\\rho_yH_x^2\\n+\\\\mu\\\\rho_xH_y^2\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\rho}{\\\\chi}P^2\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}|D_\\\\rho P|^2\\n\\\\right)\\\\,dxdy\\\\le0.}\\n\\\\]\\n这是 genuine dissipative identity，但它属于不完美匹配的吸收层。\\n\\n零耗散空间由上式刻画：若\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\rho E=0,\\\\quad \\\\rho_yH_x=0,\\\\quad \\\\rho_xH_y=0,\\\\quad \\\\rho P=0,\\\\quad\\nD_\\\\rho P=0,\\n\\\\]\\n并满足 Maxwell 主方程，则耗散为零。物理未阻尼区域中的定常磁场模式属于这种零空间。\\n\\n### 6.2 标准 stretched-coordinate PML 的朴素能量\\n\\n对精确匹配的 stretched-coordinate ADE 模型，朴素物理 Debye 能量仍是\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mathcal E_{\\\\rm phys}\\n=\\\\frac12\\\\int_\\\\Omega\\n\\\\left(\\n\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E^2+\\\\mu H_x^2+\\\\mu H_y^2+\\\\chi^{-1}P^2\\n\\\\right)\\\\,dxdy.\\n\\\\]\\n使用\\n\\\\[\\nE P_t\\n=\\\\frac{1}{2\\\\chi}\\\\partial_t(P^2)+\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}P_t^2\\n\\\\]\\n和 PEC flux 消去，得到\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\frac{d}{dt}\\\\mathcal E_{\\\\rm phys}\\n=-\\\\int_\\\\Omega\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}P_t^2\\\\,dxdy\\n+\\\\int_\\\\Omega\\n\\\\left[\\nE(\\\\psi_{E,x}-\\\\psi_{E,y})\\n-H_x\\\\psi_{H_x,y}\\n+H_y\\\\psi_{H_y,x}\\n\\\\right]\\\\,dxdy .\\n\\\\]\\n边界项为\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\int_{\\\\partial\\\\Omega}E(H_y n_x-H_x n_y)\\\\,ds,\\n\\\\]\\n在 PEC 外边界为零，在内部材料/PML 界面由切向迹连续抵消。\\n\\n最后一行的 ADE 记忆耦合项没有固定符号。因此朴素能量不是完整二维单调能量。一个\\n完整证明必须加入 Baffet 型 shifted/time-integrated 变量或正的 passive-memory 能量。\\n\\n### 6.3 法向入射一维 stretched PML 的正耗散恒等式\\n\\n在 \\\\(x\\\\)-PML 法向入射块 \\\\(k_y=0\\\\) 中，精确 stretched 模型化为\\n\\\\[\\n(\\\\partial_t+\\\\rho)(\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E+P)=\\\\partial_xH_y,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mu(\\\\partial_t+\\\\rho)H_y=\\\\partial_xE,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\nP+\\\\tau P_t=\\\\chi E.\\n\\\\]\\n注意这里 Debye law 仍是 \\\\(P+\\\\tau P_t=\\\\chi E\\\\)，不是 v2 的\\n\\\\(P+\\\\tau(\\\\partial_t+\\\\rho)P=\\\\chi E\\\\)。\\n\\n取\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\boxed{\\n\\\\mathcal E_{1d,sc}\\n=\\\\frac12\\\\int_I\\\\left(\\n\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E^2+\\\\mu H_y^2\\n+\\\\frac{1+\\\\rho\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}P^2\\n\\\\right)\\\\,dx.}\\n\\\\]\\n由\\n\\\\[\\nE=\\\\frac{P+\\\\tau P_t}{\\\\chi}\\n\\\\]\\n得到\\n\\\\[\\nE P_t=\\\\frac{1}{2\\\\chi}\\\\partial_t(P^2)+\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}P_t^2,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\rho E P\\n=\\\\frac{\\\\rho}{\\\\chi}P^2+\\\\frac{\\\\rho\\\\tau}{2\\\\chi}\\\\partial_t(P^2).\\n\\\\]\\n乘以 \\\\(E,H_y\\\\) 并分部积分后，\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\boxed{\\n\\\\frac{d}{dt}\\\\mathcal E_{1d,sc}\\n=-\\\\int_I\\\\left(\\n\\\\rho\\\\epsilon_0\\\\epsilon_\\\\infty E^2\\n+\\\\mu\\\\rho H_y^2\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\rho}{\\\\chi}P^2\\n+\\\\frac{\\\\tau}{\\\\chi}P_t^2\\n\\\\right)\\\\,dx\\n+\\\\int_{\\\\partial I}EH_y n_x\\\\,ds.}\\n\\\\]\\n在 PEC 或非正通量边界下，这是单调耗散恒等式。该结果说明标准 stretched repair\\n并非与能量方法冲突；困难出现在完整二维斜入射/ADE 耦合。\\n\\n## 7. Obstructions and impossibility statements\\n\\n### 7.1 旧八变量模型的 verified edge obstruction\\n\\n旧模型中\\n\\\\[\\nM_x=Q_x+\\\\mu\\\\frac{\\\\sigma_x}{\\\\epsilon_0}H_x\\n\\\\]\\n在 \\\\(x\\\\)-edge、\\\\(\\\\sigma_x=s>0,\\\\sigma_y=0\\\\)、zero-transverse 模式下为常数。取\\n\\\\[\\nE=P=P_{z,1}=P_{z,2}=H_y=Q_y=0\\n\\\\]\\n且 \\\\(H_x,Q_x\\\\) 空间常数，则\\n\\\\[\\nH_x(t)=H_x(0)+\\\\frac{M_x(0)}{\\\\mu}t,\\n\\\\qquad\\nQ_x(t)=Q_x(0)-\\\\frac{s}{\\\\epsilon_0}M_x(0)t.\\n\\\\]\\n这排除了旧八变量模型对所有变量的无条件正单调能量或长时间一致有界能量。v2 删除\\n独立的 \\\\(P_{z,i},Q_i\\\\)，所以去掉了这个 Jordan mode，但代价是失去 perfect matching。\\n\\n### 7.2 全域严格衰减的零空间障碍\\n\\n如果物理区域内 \\\\(\\\\sigma_x=\\\\sigma_y=0\\\\)，取\\n\\\\[\\nE=0,\\\\qquad P=0,\\\\qquad H_x=\\\\partial_x\\\\phi,\\\\qquad H_y=\\\\partial_y\\\\phi,\\n\\\\]\\n其中 \\\\(\\\\phi\\\\) 光滑且支撑在该物理区域内，则\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\partial_xH_y-\\\\partial_yH_x=0,\\\\qquad\\n\\\\partial_xE=\\\\partial_yE=0.\\n\\\\]\\n所有 PML auxiliary 若初值为零则保持零；该非零磁能态是定常解。因此任何总能量都不可能\\n对全域所有非零态严格下降。最多能证明\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\frac{d}{dt}\\\\mathcal E(t)=-\\\\mathcal D(t),\\\\qquad \\\\mathcal D(t)\\\\ge0,\\n\\\\]\\n并准确说明 \\\\(\\\\mathcal D(t)=0\\\\) 的零空间。\\n\\n### 7.3 Cole--Cole/fractional extension\\n\\n分数阶极化不能修复与 \\\\(P\\\\) 无关的电磁/PML 失配。旧八变量 edge obstruction 可取\\n\\\\(P=0\\\\)，v2 matching 失配中即使 \\\\(\\\\chi=0\\\\) 也有斜入射项失配。因此 fractional law 只能在\\n已经确定的 matched Maxwell PML 上作为正记忆材料能量加入。若要声称 fractional theorem，\\n必须写出正的 diffusive/memory 表示；本报告不声称该 theorem。\\n\\n## 8. Recommendation for the next manuscript step\\n\\n下一步 manuscript 应分成两个互不混淆的 theorem。\\n\\n**Theorem A: perfect matching.** 使用标准 stretched-coordinate 或 CFS/ADE\\nMaxwell--Debye PML：\\n\\\\[\\ns\\\\varepsilon_D(s)\\\\widehat E\\n=S_x^{-1}\\\\partial_x\\\\widehat H_y-S_y^{-1}\\\\partial_y\\\\widehat H_x,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\mu s\\\\widehat H_x=-S_y^{-1}\\\\partial_y\\\\widehat E,\\\\qquad\\n\\\\mu s\\\\widehat H_y=S_x^{-1}\\\\partial_x\\\\widehat E,\\n\\\\]\\n\\\\[\\n(1+\\\\tau s)\\\\widehat P=\\\\chi\\\\widehat E.\\n\\\\]\\n证明平面界面处 \\\\(\\\\nu_+=S_i\\\\nu_0\\\\)、\\\\(Y_+=Y_0\\\\)、\\\\(R=0\\\\)。\\n\\n**Theorem B: energy/stability.** 有两个可行方向：\\n\\n1. 若使用 v2 协变阻尼模型，则 theorem 是单调稳定吸收层 theorem，不应称为 PML。\\n2. 若坚持 exact stretched-coordinate PML，则从上面的 1D 正耗散恒等式出发，构造完整二维\\n   Baffet/passive-memory augmented energy，用来吸收\\n\\\\[\\nE\\\\psi_{E,x},\\\\quad E\\\\psi_{E,y},\\\\quad H_x\\\\psi_{H_x,y},\\\\quad H_y\\\\psi_{H_y,x}.\\n\\\\]\\n\\n目前已验证的最强稳定结论是：v2 的单调能量成立但 v2 不 perfect matched；标准\\nstretched-coordinate 模型修复了 matching，并在 1D 法向入射块中有正耗散恒等式；完整二维\\n单调能量仍未闭合。\\n\\n## Assembly\\n\\nFact index 中列出的已验证事实给出旧模型 obstruction、Gronwall fallback、v2 单调能量、\\nv2 matching 失效、标准 stretched-coordinate matching/1D 能量，以及全域严格衰减的零空间\\nobstruction。由这些事实组装得到：\\n\\n- v2 的 \\\\(D_\\\\rho\\\\) Debye law 把物理 \\\\(\\\\varepsilon_D(s)\\\\) 改为\\n  \\\\(\\\\varepsilon_D(s+\\\\rho)\\\\)，并改变斜入射导纳项，所以不是 perfectly matched。\\n- 标准 stretched-coordinate Maxwell--Debye PML 保持 \\\\(\\\\varepsilon_D(s)\\\\) 并只拉伸空间导数，\\n  因此平面界面导纳不变。\\n- 能量结论必须按模型分类：v2 单调但不匹配；标准 stretched PML 匹配，1D 法向入射块单调，\\n  完整二维 ADE 能量仍需要 augmented 变量。\\n\\n这回答了 stage-3 目标的核心分歧：v2 不能作为最终 PML；下一步应以标准\\nstretched-coordinate/ADE 模型为 matching theorem 的基础，并另行建立 Baffet 型二维能量。\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T070357651402Z-assembly-stage-3-terminal-report-results/codex.events.jsonl:34:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_16\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,240p' verification/results/verify-20260619T180514214437Z-fact-alpha-1-pec-balance-and-shifted-mag.json\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"iteris.verification_result.v0\\\",\\n  \\\"request_id\\\": \\\"verify-20260619T180514214437Z-fact-alpha-1-pec-balance-and-shifted-mag\\\",\\n  \\\"backend\\\": \\\"agent\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"fact\\\",\\n  \\\"claim\\\": \\\"Alpha=1 PEC balance and shifted magnetic identities are valid for the source Maxwell-PML system.\\\",\\n  \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"passed\\\": true,\\n  \\\"strict_verdict\\\": \\\"correct\\\",\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Correct. The cited proof uses the same alpha=1 Maxwell-PML equations, PEC boundary condition, positivity assumptions, and shifted-variable definitions as the source problem. The electromagnetic balance follows by multiplying by E, H_x, H_y and integrating; the principal part is the boundary flux integral int_dOmega E(H_y n_x - H_x n_y) ds, which vanishes under E=0 on the PEC boundary. The alpha=1 polarization correction is valid in the integrated L2 sense, yielding the positive added energy (1/(2 chi))||P||_2^2 and dissipation (tau/chi)||P_t||_2^2. The shifted magnetic identities follow from M_x=Q_x-mu a_x H_x, M_y=Q_y-mu a_y H_y, time-independent coefficients, and b_x+a_x=b_y, b_y+a_y=b_x; substituting Q=M+mu a H cancels the sign-indefinite magnetic square terms and leaves H_x M_x+H_y M_y.\\\",\\n  \\\"critical_errors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"gaps\\\": [],\\n  \\\"repair_hints\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"checked_artifacts\\\": [\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-alpha1-algebra-balance.md\\\",\\n    \\\"memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-run-20260619T173930696222Z-source-problem.md\\\",\\n    \\\"artifacts/proofs/alpha1_algebra_balance.md\\\",\\n    \\\"sources/energy_functional_problem.tex\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"checked_fact_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:alpha1-algebra-balance\\\",\\n    \\\"fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:run-20260619T173930696222Z:source-problem\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"primary_fact_ids\\\": [],\\n  \\\"target_artifact\\\": null,\\n  \\\"executor\\\": \\\"codex\\\",\\n  \\\"verification_scope\\\": \\\"codex_agent\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_ceiling_after_verification\\\": \\\"verified\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_run_dir\\\": \\\"verification/agent_runs/verify-20260619T180514214437Z-fact-alpha-1-pec-balance-and-shifted-mag\\\",\\n  \\\"agent_log\\\": \\\"ve