,\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/verification.json:3:    \"summary\": \"Correct. The cited stage-3 proof uses the verified covariantly damped Maxwell-Debye model from the predecessor fact and the source TM sign conventions. For the physical Maxwell-Debye half-space, the Laplace-Fourier symbol gives H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu_0 E/(mu s), nu_0^2=k_y^2+mu s^2 A(s), hence Y_0^2=A(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2). For the constant x-layer v2 model with rho_x=rho>0 and rho_y=0, the same symbol gives P=chi E/(1+tau(s+rho)), H_x=-ik_y E/(mu s), H_y=nu E/(mu(s+rho)), nu^2=mu(s+rho)^2 A_rho(s)+k_y^2(s+rho)/s, hence Y_rho^2=A_rho(s)/mu+k_y^2/(mu^2 s(s+rho)). Subtracting gives exactly -rho[chi tau/(mu(1+tau(s+rho))(1+tau s))+k_y^2/(mu^2 s^2(s+rho))], matching the fact file and the boxed formula in the proof artifact. Since this expression is not identically zero for rho>0 under the stated positive Debye parameters, the admittance mismatch is generically nonzero and the continuous planar-interface reflection coefficient is generically nonzero. The claim is scoped to this planar constant-coefficient x-interface test and does not overclaim more.\",\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T043606452654Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/codex.log:2:command: /Users/wcli/.local/bin/codex exec --json -C '/Users/wcli/Desktop/资料/graduate_student/博五/further_PML/2D_Maxwell_PML_Energy_Functional_Exploration' -m gpt-5 --config model_reasoning_effort=high --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox -\n./verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/codex.events.jsonl:10:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_2\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,240p' verification/agent_runs/verify-20260620T064341474739Z-fact-the-v2-covariantly-damped-maxwell-d/request.json\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"iteris.v